evidence = "services/wallet/demo/vitest.config.ts:5 still configures JSX only through esbuild while services/wallet/demo/tsconfig.json:8 preserves JSX and services/wallet/pnpm-lock.yaml:322 selects Vitest 4.1.12 with Vite 8.3.5 and services/wallet/pnpm-lock.yaml:17768 selects Rolldown 1.2.16, leaving the JSX at services/wallet/demo/src/components/FundedAccountPanel.test.tsx:24 and services/wallet/demo/src/components/FundedAccountPanel.test.tsx:49 exposed to the reported collection failure with identical configuration and panel-test blobs at commits 88761d5290c4a874293b4ca26b03ad8a790be1f6 and 95e12fab1303f5c8ecbb816e91eca0f64bf04420; the historical TODO detail is superseded by the implemented test at services/wallet/demo/src/components/Completion.test.tsx:266, and input/1876.md concerns a separate frozen-install defect addressed by commit 661007bc72."
close_comment = "The demo's JSX configuration still does not match its locked Vite 8 test toolchain, so the supported-wallet panel tests need a transformer repair. A focused wallet task will configure the supported JSX transformer and add a collection regression check that requires both existing panel tests to pass with their assertions intact."

